  "three_rings_jackknife": "Leave one of three rings out and refit all five parameters. If any replicate is unconverged, physically inadmissible, or has a rank-deficient normalized Jacobian, hold tilt fixed in all three replicates. In that fallback, use full-fit covariance for the tilts and its standard errors as floors on x, y and L.",
